7-beta2_linux\n-Not Reproducible: Godot_v4.6.2-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7-beta2 - Linux Mint 22.1 - X11\n\n### Issue description\n\nCurrent stable version clips long project tile but keeps everything within the Project manager accessible, no window resize needed\n\n <img width=\"1158\" height=\"840\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a49c8c8-4736-4ee1-8cdd-359b09c35317\" />\n\n4.7beta2 prioritizes fit to full project title and clips/pushes all the project manager buttons only accessible through resizing (and Project manager doesn't save dimensions so it's back to hiding each time it's opened)\n\n<img width=\"1158\" height=\"840\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6177474-87ea-49c8-b1af-40815d6ce875\" />\n\nWhile using short project names sounds sensible, previous behavior seemed to work better while not breaking the window proportions or functionality.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nHave a project with a name longer than the default Project manager window width.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_v